                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7008ee9a-75f7-300c-8ff5-03957713a328",
                        "entry_id": "0d6cf9c8-c684-3192-9d2b-9b189b589453",
                        "glosses": [
                            "niedobór towarów lub pieniędzy w sklepie, kasie, magazynie itp. w stosunku do stanu wynikającego z ewidencji"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "05fd1411-c715-4c3e-a4fe-bb40408e9b3c",
                                "sense_id": "7008ee9a-75f7-300c-8ff5-03957713a328",
                                "text": "Co miesiąc nasz premier z Gdańska robi manko na 5 miliardów złotych"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cabe3db9-fa1b-409f-8410-825ca69caf8c",
                                "sense_id": "7008ee9a-75f7-300c-8ff5-03957713a328",
                                "text": "Hania spowodowała manko, które będzie musiała pokryć z własnej kieszeni."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2abd9430-4e02-4800-ba98-1136d51b13c6",
                        "source_entry_id": "0d6cf9c8-c684-3192-9d2b-9b189b589453",
                        "source_sense_id": "7008ee9a-75f7-300c-8ff5-03957713a328",
                        "target_lang_word": "deficit",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "deficit",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1c395ae1-4f93-3089-8600-dfe2a331e9da",
                                        "entry_id": "35450bd7-3f19-38d8-bb1a-0c1a096f9eea",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Deficiency in amount or quality; a falling short; lack."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "caff793e-930c-4621-82cd-55c3f2793889",
                                                "sense_id": "1c395ae1-4f93-3089-8600-dfe2a331e9da",
                                                "text": "The crop output this year has been comparatively small, owing to the deficit in rainfall."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6a9ae63c-696d-3c16-8e75-c3a60305c376",
                                        "entry_id": "35450bd7-3f19-38d8-bb1a-0c1a096f9eea",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A situation wherein, or amount whereby, spending exceeds (e.g. government) revenue."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e5135342-ded4-4d72-9f3e-96d69c9c8a88",
                                                "sense_id": "6a9ae63c-696d-3c16-8e75-c3a60305c376",
                                                "text": "Dr. Beeching's obvious intent is that if Scottish—and similarly unprofitable English and Welsh—railways are to be maintained, it must be done by an unconcealed subsidy; he is determined that the railways shall no longer be preoccupied with—and derided for—immense deficits which include the burden of social services the State must openly underwrite, if it wants them."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4fb7cdbd-0e59-4662-978a-73c764ef03c9",
                                                "sense_id": "6a9ae63c-696d-3c16-8e75-c3a60305c376",
                                                "text": "But Wall Street, which has a case of deficit-attention disorder, is no longer focused on a balanced budget. \"The bond market only worries about one thing at [a time.]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c7a5cb78-dc15-40db-b5de-704f5aebc62d",
                                                "sense_id": "6a9ae63c-696d-3c16-8e75-c3a60305c376",
                                                "text": "Economically, too, London is startlingly different. The capital, unlike the country as a whole, has no budget deficit: London’s public spending matches the taxes paid in the city. The average Londoner contributes 70 percent more to Britain’s national income than people in the rest of the country."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3e48c512-b588-4182-bcf7-bbc06496fada",
                        "source_entry_id": "0d6cf9c8-c684-3192-9d2b-9b189b589453",
                        "source_sense_id": "7008ee9a-75f7-300c-8ff5-03957713a328",
                        "target_lang_word": "Manko",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Manko",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3d9c9b40-b9e1-3b7d-9519-97874d34d2f0",
                                        "entry_id": "6eda3308-28f0-37ee-a261-cc23d351b972",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "etwas, was als Fehler oder Nachteil empfunden wird"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "714d0bd7-d013-435b-ae23-7f95d59bebf8",
                                                "sense_id": "3d9c9b40-b9e1-3b7d-9519-97874d34d2f0",
                                                "text": "Das ist aber ein schwerwiegendes Manko!"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9ee155a4-7df2-3386-9e02-23b1a214376d",
                                        "entry_id": "6eda3308-28f0-37ee-a261-cc23d351b972",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Geldbetrag, der (bei der Abrechnung) fehlt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f5bb0749-227a-4d6b-9638-7fc20c633496",
                                                "sense_id": "9ee155a4-7df2-3386-9e02-23b1a214376d",
                                                "text": "Das Manko wurde beim Kassensturz entdeckt."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "04452ca6-fce5-42b5-987e-1c48c3a4fd78",
                        "source_entry_id": "0d6cf9c8-c684-3192-9d2b-9b189b589453",
                        "source_sense_id": "7008ee9a-75f7-300c-8ff5-03957713a328",
                        "target_lang_word": "недостача",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "недостача",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3886cded-86c5-3455-be0e-d10bdf67d33e",
                                        "entry_id": "1f9efd58-102a-3240-a350-2309b25bd890",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "разг. отсутствие нужного количества кого-либо, чего-либо; нехватка"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ab5afe6e-8e60-4ed8-b5ec-6c8e1c55a939",
                                                "sense_id": "3886cded-86c5-3455-be0e-d10bdf67d33e",
                                                "text": "— Ну, если когда вина недостача, ещё не велика беда, потерпеть можно, зато есть что слаще и вина и мёду."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ce4b62a-1950-40df-b680-434b351b755b",
                                                "sense_id": "3886cded-86c5-3455-be0e-d10bdf67d33e",
                                                "text": "А когда в доме была недостача в хлебе, Федорка отдавала всё братишке, а сама перебивалась не евши."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "67db50b7-8346-36e1-8f5f-ea35969e217c",
                                        "entry_id": "1f9efd58-102a-3240-a350-2309b25bd890",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "фин. отсутствие денег, товаров и т. п., обнаруженное при проверке у ответственных за них лиц в магазине, кассе, учреждении и т. п"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "142432a7-196f-4293-a942-57aedaf0897f",
                                                "sense_id": "67db50b7-8346-36e1-8f5f-ea35969e217c",
                                                "text": "Клиент имеет право: заявлять претензии о недостаче наличных денежных средств, выявленной при пересчёте денежной наличности в помещении Банка и в присутствии представителя Банка"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
